      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ABERDEEN FLYER (8) has the right profile to take beating after resuming with a close second to Without Reg at Ascot, where he was sent out favourite and beaten just over half a length. His Listed record is already strong, Chris Parnham stays with him and the 1600m is another plus. ROYAL TORONADO (3) brings the deeper current form, having run second in the Listed Farnley Stakes before finishing third as favourite in a BM84+ at Belmont and his two wins from two starts at this venue read well. MEMORY PARADE (10) is a sharper chance than her last-start eighth suggests after blundering and being hampered at Ascot, with her prior BM84+ fourth keeping her in the mix. OLY'S CHOICE (5) is flying and comes off a BM72+ win over Silent Diva at Ascot, gets weight relief and has an excellent 1600m record. He has to be respected on the quick back up.",
